    , (Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine of` 10000, `no fine is stated`)   -- limb 2: the limb the text states

@ref s 447(2) (the class of the offence) (src:7861-7864)
